{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/452", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What is the fan in an AWG made of?\", \"response\": \"The fan in an AWG (Air-to-Water Heat Exchanger) is typically made of plastic or metal. The material used depends on the specific design of the AWG and the operating conditions.\\n\\nPlastic fans are typically used in smaller, portable AWGs and are made of materials such as polypropylene or polyethylene. These fans are lightweight and cost-effective, but they may not be as durable as metal fans.\\n\\nMetal fans, such as aluminum or stainless steel, are used in larger AWGs and are more durable than plastic fans. They can handle higher air pressures and temperatures, making them suitable for use in industrial or commercial applications.\\n\\nThe fan in an AWG is responsible for drawing in ambient air and passing it over the heat exchanger. The heat exchanger transfers the heat from the air to the water, which is then used for various applications such as cooling, heating, or generating electricity.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/796", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What is the strongest character in game of thrones?\", \"response\": \"In Game of Thrones, there are several characters who could be considered among the strongest in terms of physical prowess, strategic abilities, and magical powers. Here are a few of the strongest characters:\\n\\n1. Jon Snow: Jon Snow is a skilled warrior and leader who has survived multiple battles and has a deep understanding of the White Walker threat. He is also very skilled with a sword and has proven himself to be a brave and strategic leader.\\n\\n2. Daenerys Targaryen: Daenerys is a powerful sorceress who has a unique ability to control dragons. She is also a skilled military leader and has gathered a powerful army of warriors and allies.\\n\\n3. Cersei Lannister: Cersei is a cunning and ruthless politician who has taken control of the Iron Throne and is one of the few characters who has the power to match Daenerys in terms of magical abilities.\\n\\n4. Arya Stark: Arya is a skilled warrior and assassin who has undergone extensive training in combat and the use of weapons. She is also very clever and resourceful, and has shown herself to be a formidable opponent in battle.\\n\\n5. Tyrion Lannister: Tyrion is a smart and savvy politician who has served as the Hand of the King (and Queen) on multiple occasions. He is also a skilled strategist and has a deep understanding of human nature.\\n\\nUltimately, the strongest character in Game of Thrones varies depending on the situation and the specific skills required for a given challenge. These characters are all formidable in their own right and have played a critical role in shaping the fate of the Seven Kingdoms.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/32", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I live in Australia. I am thinking about purchasing a car. It will be mostly a town car, but it might every once in a great while have to make a trip from Canberra to Sydney. I would like to be environmentally friendly and go electric, but I am concerned about the lack of charging stations for electric cars. A hybrid car may be the solution since I don't have to use a charging station. I am not necessarily committed to buying a new car and would consider buying a pre-owned car. Our driveway makes a car with a low clearance problematic, so an SUV might be a possibility. What would you recommend?\", \"response\": \"Here are some recommendations based on your needs and preferences:\\n\\n1. Electric car: If you're looking to be environmentally friendly and reduce your carbon footprint, an electric car could be a good option. However, you may need to plan ahead and map out charging stations along your route from Canberra to Sydney. Some popular electric cars in Australia include the Tesla Model 3, the Hyundai IONIQ Electric, and the Kia Niro EV.\\n\\n2. Hybrid car: If you're concerned about the lack of charging stations for electric cars, a hybrid car could be a good compromise. You can still reduce your environmental impact while having the flexibility of a traditional gasoline-powered engine for longer trips. Some popular hybrid cars in Australia include the Toyota Corolla Hybrid, the Hyundai IONIQ Hybrid, and the Honda Accord Hybrid.\\n\\n3. SUV: If you need a vehicle with more space and versatility, an SUV could be a good option. You can still consider hybrid or electric SUVs if you're looking to reduce your environmental impact. Some popular hybrid and electric SUVs in Australia include the Toyota RAV4 Hybrid, the Hyundai Tucson Hybrid, and the Tesla Model Y.\\n\\n4. Pre-owned car: If you're open to buying a pre-owned car, you may be able to find a good deal on a vehicle that meets your needs. You can look for a car with low mileage and a good maintenance history to ensure it's in good condition.\\n\\nWhen considering your options, it's important to do your research and take into account factors such as cost, fuel efficiency, safety features, and reliability. It's also a good idea to test drive different vehicles to get a feel for how they handle and what features you find most important.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
